@startuml
!include style.iuml
left to right direction
rectangle "Next.js API" as API
rectangle "Python worker" as W
database "PostgreSQL\nNguồn dữ liệu chuẩn" as DB {
 rectangle "documents\nid, user_id, storage_path,\nindex_version, embedding_profile,\nvector_collection" as D
 rectangle "document_chunks\nid, document_id, user_id,\nindex_version, content" as C
}
rectangle "Object storage\nSupabase Storage" as storage {
 artifact "documents (private)\n<user_uuid>/<document_uuid>.pdf hoặc .docx" as O
}
database "Vector database\nQdrant collection" as vector {
 rectangle "Point\nid = chunk.id\npayload: user_id, document_id,\nchunk_id, index_version" as V
}
API --> DB : RLS / RPC
API --> storage : Ký URL sau kiểm tra quyền
W --> DB : SQL / xác minh dữ liệu chuẩn
W --> storage : Đọc / xóa object
W --> vector : upsert / search / delete
D ..> O : storage_path / locator logic
C ..> V : chunk.id / locator logic
@enduml
